<title>USA: MGIC Investment buys back 4.3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>MGIC Investment buys back 4.3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MGIC Investment Corp said Wednesday it has bought about 4.3 million shares of its stock under a previously announced repurchase program.</p>
<p>The shares were repurchased on July 15 from a financial intermediary at a price of $46.9375 a share, subject to a market price adjustment provision, the company said.</p>
<p>The financial intermediary has advised MGIC it borrowed stock to complete the transaction and will buy replacement shares in the open market. Funds for the shares repurchased by the company will be provided under a revolving credit facility established in June 1997.</p>
<p>(( -- Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
